      The Holding Company has 
      received legal demand notice from Ambit Energy Private Limited (the 
      “Customer”) dated April 18, 2022, through the legal counsel of the 
      Customer claiming Rs. 65.80 million towards failure to resolve technical 
      faults and errors in inverters supplied by the Company to the Customer and 
      towards commercial as well as potential business generation loss and 
      Goodwill.
    
