      The holding Company has replied 
      to the legal counsel of the Customer vide its letter dated May 11, 2022, 
      rejecting all the claims of the Customer stating it to be unjust, illegal 
      and with malicious intention. Further the matter is posted in District 
      court mediation center, Rajkot for pre-mediation. The pre-mediation 
      request has been refused by the holding company because the financial 
      claim by Complainant is malicious and with the intention to arm-twist the 
      holding company to extract money fraudulently. The holding company has 
      been providing and continues to provide all under warranty services till 
      date. Hearing dated 27.03.2024 in which the Company has filed 
      objections against the plaintiff.Stage is planttiff has to file 
      statement of Truth' and as per civil courts summer vacation next date post 
      vacation is June 13, 2025
  
    
